   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENH301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 9 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11907 · Decision 862/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 16/08/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENH301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>9 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11907 · QĐ 862/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 16/08/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Use present and past tenses<br>Use vocabulary relating to money matters, describing locations<br>Apply professional skills in marketing<br>Design a tour</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Use modal verbs<br>Describe types of accommodation, facilities and services<br>Apply professional skills when dealing with complaints<br>Investigate customer complaints</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Use articles in spoken and written language<br>Describe weather, climate, features and attractions<br>Apply professional skills in offering advice<br>Develop a destination</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Use conditional structures with if<br>Descibe geographical features, attractions, activities, works of art<br>Apply professional skills when speaking to a group<br>Plan a coach tour</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Use verb + infinitive or -ing form<br>Use vocabulary to describe sectors in niche tourism<br>Apply professional skills when dealing with figures<br>Improve client security</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Use the passive<br>Use vocabulary to describe culture, use linking words<br>Apply professional skills when taking part in meetings<br>Present a proposal</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Use have/get something done<br>Use adjectives ending in -ed/-ing<br>Apply professional skills when making presentations</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Use question forms<br>Use vocabulary to dedscribe customer service terms, personal qualities, multi-word verbs<br>Apply professional skills when handling telephone conversations<br>Improve customer service</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Use past perfect<br>Use idioms and metaphors<br>Apply professional skills when socializing and making small talk</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11907\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11907</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11907\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11907</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
